# COSMOQ About Page Extraction

**URL**: `https://cosmoq.framer.website/about`

---

## Page Structure

```
├── Navigation
├── Hero Section
├── Values Section (We are committed)
├── Founder Section
├── Team Section (Meet the Cosmoq Minds)
├── Join Us Section
├── Footer CTA
└── Footer
```

---

## Section 1: Hero

### Content
- **H1**: "Shaping the Future of Enterprise"
- **Description**: "Connect any app or system pre-built or custom with ease and flexibility."
- **Label**: "OUR VALUES"

---

## Section 2: Values (We are committed)

### Content
- **H2**: "We are committed"
- **Description**: "Driven by innovation, integrity, and impact in every solution we build."

### Value Cards
| Title | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| Pioneering Smarter Enterprise Solutions | We push the boundaries of AI to create smarter, faster, and more efficient enterprise solutions. |
| Driven by Trust and Transparency | We act with honesty, transparency, and accountability, ensuring reliability and excellence. |
| Delivering Measurable Business Results | Our AI Agents deliver measurable, lasting results that transform the way businesses operate and grow. |

