## Section 5: Join Us

### Content
- **Label**: "JOIN US"
- **H2**: "Join us as we build tomorrow's enterprise."
- **Description**: "Be a part of a company that is reimagining the future of business, building AI Agents that are effective and impactful for large enterprises. At Cosmoq, you'll collaborate with some of the brightest minds in AI, driving innovation at scale."
- **CTA**: "Join Our Team" → `https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/`

