## CSS Notes

Same base styles as home page with:
```css
/* Team grid */
.team-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 32px;
}

/* Card hover effect */
.team-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}
```
